config MEMC_NXP_AHB_SRAMC
	bool "NXP AHB SRAM Controller (AHB_SRAMC)"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_NXP_AHB_SRAMC_ENABLED
	select PINCTRL
	help
	  Enable the NXP AHB SRAM Controller driver, found on i.MX RT266x. The
	  driver programs the bus timing of each populated chip select through
	  the MCUXpresso SDK sramc_1 HAL at init, which leaves the external
	  asynchronous parallel SRAM usable as a memory-mapped window.

	  This is a different block from the one MEMC_NXP_SRAMC drives, whose
	  registers sit inside BLK_CTRL_WAKEUPMIX on i.MX RT118x and which uses
	  the SDK sramc HAL. Both HALs ship a header named fsl_sramc.h that
	  declares the same symbols over different register types, so no single
	  build can contain both drivers.
